div>\n<p>For durations that are convertible to both <span class=\"t-lc\">std::chrono::years</span> and <span class=\"t-lc\">std::chrono::months</span>, the <code>years</code> overloads <span class=\"t-v\">(1,3)</span> are preferred if the call would otherwise be ambiguous.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cassert&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;chrono&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> ymwi<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"sy2\">/</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/weekday\"><span class=\"kw2579\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">Wednesday</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"nu0\">2</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"sy2\">/</span><span class=\"nu0\">2021</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> ymwi <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    ymwi <span class=\"sy2\">+</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/duration\"><span class=\"kw1007\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">years</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">5</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> ymwi <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/error/assert\"><span class=\"kw778\">assert</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw1\">static_cast</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/year_month_day\"><span class=\"kw2574\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">year_month_day</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>ymwi<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span>\n                       <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/year\"><span class=\"kw2636\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">year</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">2026</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy2\">/</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"sy2\">/</span><span class=\"nu0\">14</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    ymwi <span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/duration\"><span class=\"kw1006\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">months</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> ymwi <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/error/assert\"><span class=\"kw778\">assert</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw1\">static_cast</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/year_month_day\"><span class=\"kw2574\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">year_month_day</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>ymwi<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> \n                       <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/day\"><span class=\"kw2620\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">day</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">10</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy2\">/</span><span class=\"nu0\">12</span><span class=\"sy2\">/</span><span class=\"nu0\">2025</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>2021/Jan/Wed[2]\n2026/Jan/Wed[2]\n2025/Dec/Wed[2]</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/year_month_weekday/operator_arith_2\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator+</span><span>operator-</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  adds or subtracts a <code>year_month_weekday</code> and some number of years or months <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"chrono","title":"Date and time utilities"},{"path":"chrono/year_month_weekday","title":"std::chrono::year_month_weekday"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::chrono::year_month_weekday::operator+=, std::chrono::year_month_weekday::operator-=","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"4 declarations; revisions: since C++20. Modifies the time point *this represents by the duration dy or dm."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"operator+, operator-","note":"adds or subtracts a year_month_weekday and some number of years or months"}]}]},"standards":["C++20"],"w